 "name_en": "Returnable Packaging to Vendor (2UU)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Returnable Packaging to Vendor (2UU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This process covers when a goods supplier sends a Nota Fiscal with a material and a returnable package, and requests return of the latter item, usually due to the expense of the pallet.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This process covers two Notas Fiscais. The goods supplier sends one Nota Fiscal containing the material and another Nota Fiscal with the returnable package.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Preview goods receipt slip in PDF</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create supplier invoice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt only for package material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issues for returnable package material</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Cover the returnable package localization requirements for Brazil</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>供应商的可回收包装 (2UU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程涵盖货物供应商发送包含物料和可回收包装的发票的时间，并请求退回后一种项目（通常由于托盘费用）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程涵盖两个发票。货物供应商发送一个包含物料的发票，以及另一个包含可回收包装的发票。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">预览 PDF 格式的收货单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建供应商发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">仅为包装物料过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账可回收包装物料的发货</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1523b1cd167d4073affef8a02fd8770d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">满足巴西的可回收包装本地化要求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
